WEBVTT

00:00:03,890 --> 00:00:09,250
So there's a lot of different types of autoimmune disorders depending on what cell structure,

00:00:09,250 --> 00:00:10,250
what tissue.

00:00:10,250 --> 00:00:16,370
An autoimmune disease is named after the primary tissue of destruction.

00:00:16,370 --> 00:00:20,930
That is why a person, they have started out with thyroid issues, and then they ended up

00:00:20,930 --> 00:00:24,370
with arthritis issues, and then they ended up with MS.

00:00:24,370 --> 00:00:28,330
Oh, I got three autoimmune disease, no, you're only got one.

00:00:28,330 --> 00:00:34,600
It's just destroyed three different tissues, and it's just continuing to progress.

00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:37,240
So you have to find out what the antigen is, and you have to figure out how you're going

00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:42,920
to get rid of that antigen, and that's another five-hour lecture itself.

00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:45,400
But you've got to find somebody that will help that.

00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:50,480
And you talk about biotoxins that your immune system is unable to kill.

00:00:50,480 --> 00:00:51,480
Hello?

00:00:51,480 --> 00:00:56,120
Anybody spell RIFE for me?

00:00:56,120 --> 00:00:59,080
You know, that is a huge player.

00:00:59,080 --> 00:01:03,520
If you're going to be able to kill a biotoxin that goes into the cell, it goes inside the

00:01:03,520 --> 00:01:06,160
cell and hides inside the cell, how are you going to do it?

00:01:06,160 --> 00:01:11,040
We're going to use bigger antibiotics, are we going to use stronger nutraceuticals?

00:01:11,040 --> 00:01:16,960
Well, it's hard to use nutraceuticals to kill a biotoxin if the person's TH1 dominant,

00:01:16,960 --> 00:01:20,560
because what do you have to use to kill biotoxin if the person's TH1 dominant?

00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:23,360
You don't have a whole lot of tools in your tool bag there.

00:01:23,360 --> 00:01:26,160
You can't give TH1 stimulants.

00:01:26,160 --> 00:01:30,880
RIFE doesn't stimulate a TH1 response directly.

00:01:30,880 --> 00:01:34,720
So a huge player at killing a biotoxin.

00:01:34,720 --> 00:01:36,440
Does that make sense?

